# Ignore everything in this directory
*

# Except .gitignore and dotenv file
!.gitignore
!.env
!.env.secrets.example

# Secret files consumed via compose `secrets:`. The real values stay ignored
# by the blanket `*` above; only the .example templates are committed.
!secrets/
secrets/*
!secrets/*.example

# sabnzbd.ini is where SABnzbd keeps the real login password, api_key, and
# nzb_key (see the note in .env.secrets.example), and SABnzbd rewrites the file
# on shutdown, so the live file stays ignored. Only the sanitised seed is
# committed; `make bootstrap` copies it into place.
!config/
config/*
!config/sabnzbd.ini.example
